# Tables and subgroup words for the fixed J₂ double-coset cover

The seven generator tables and the 72 representative tables pack each point
image into seven bits. The 128 short words use the fixed `Seed.s` generators.
These are witness data; `Words` checks them against the actual carrier.
The original representative numbering and words are preserved.

Source: the retained ATLAS degree-100 data, `Placement/source/double-cosets.json`,
and `ExceptionalParabolics/source/seed.json`; see Aschbacher–Smith, printed p.511,
and GLS3 Table 5.3g. `source/generate.py` regenerates these untrusted tables.
-/

